  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1406.01 Environmental Review Required for Construction Projects",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1406.01 Environmental Review Required for Construction Projects. Any construction project for which financial assistance from the PFAS RLF is requested shall be reviewed by the department for impacts on the human and natural environment in accordance with this part.\n\nSource. #13164, eff 1-26-21; ss by #13372, eff 4-21-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1400.html"
